{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56807","headline":"青城白裘叟赠杨内侍二十八字诗（题拟） · 不详","name":"青城白裘叟赠杨内侍二十八字诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五色云英生海月，能饮南方赤龙血。\n生冷宫中住雌雄，紫金台上凝霜雪。\n（《灯下闲说》卷上《弃官遇仙》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}